  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;Underworld Passage.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>What the Deep Dark Taught You.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as a bonus action: sink partway into shadow, stone, or earth for up to one minute. While sunken: <strong>reroll-lowest</strong> on Stealth; ignore extra movement cost from difficult terrain; fit through gaps as small as one foot across; you take half qliphothic damage (narrative &mdash; GM enforces, no engine grant). The passage ends early if you are submerged in running water or take sephirotic damage.</p>",
